      "created_at": "2019-07-02T11:49:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was the funnest one-shot in quite some time. :D Just the setup is hilarious, but I had a good time playing it too.</p>\n<p>Won thanks to Imbued Fire, Bloody Knuckles and Mr. Fixer hitting himself for 3 (make that 9!) to beat the living daylights out of Blade.</p>",
