      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/dec6dc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-07-03T20:19:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep.&nbsp; Just a fun one-shot.&nbsp; I had so much fun that I was tempted to pit the Hirsute Heroes against a random villain/environment...until I realized that between them they have very little ongoing or environment destruction.&nbsp; Am I wrong, or is Mainstay the only one that can destroy ongoings/environment cards?&nbsp;</p>",
